        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\n\nONE BEDROOM APARTMENT IN DUBLIN 9\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment located in the highly sought-after Ivy Court development in Beaumont.\n\nThis well-maintained home offers a warm and inviting entrance hallway, an open-plan kitchen/living area, and direct access to a patio. The property includes a double bedroom and bathroom. Parking is not included within the rent.\n\nIvy Court is positioned within a mature and settled neighbourhood just off Skelly's Lane and Beaumont Road. Residents enjoy exceptional convenience, with Beaumont Hospital, Artane Castle Shopping Centre, OMNI Shopping Centre, and Dublin City University (DCU) all within easy reach. The area has frequent bus routes, and offers quick access to the M1 and M50.\n \n<u>Key Features:</u>\n<ul>\n <li>Spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Short walk to Beaumont Hospital</li>\n <li>Bus routes at your doorstep</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
